    <h2>1. Intelligent SMS Notification Engine</h2>
    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Ensures phone numbers are correctly formatted and sends alerts.</p>
    <pre><code>// E.164 Formatting Logic
if (formattedTo.startsWith('0')) {
  formattedTo = '+61' + formattedTo.substring(1);
}</code></pre>

    <h2>2. Booking Intelligence</h2>
    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Prevents overbooking beyond vehicle capacity.</p>
    <pre><code>if (count > vehicle.seats) {
